# open-agent-engine - Cline/Roo Instructions

> Cross-platform multi-agent scaffolding, skill package manager, and transpiler engine

## Shell Commands
- Build: `pnpm build`
- Test: `pnpm test`
- Typecheck: `pnpm typecheck`
- Dev: `pnpm dev`

## Operational Invariants
- Run all test suites before concluding any task.
- Respect module boundaries and avoid monolithic file expansions.
